{"id":"17f45a730d2e579dada3d5c350c6261777e14401","axis":"silent","repo":"duckdb/duckdb","sha":"17f45a730d2e579dada3d5c350c6261777e14401","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"src/parser/tableref/delimgetref.cpp","lines":["@@ -13,7 +13,9 @@ bool DelimGetRef::Equals(const TableRef &other) const {"," }"," "," unique_ptr<TableRef> DelimGetRef::Copy() {","-\treturn make_uniq<DelimGetRef>(types);","+\tauto copy = make_uniq<DelimGetRef>(types);","+\tCopyProperties(*copy);","+\treturn std::move(copy);"," }"," "," void DelimGetRef::Serialize(Serializer &serializer) const {"],"additions":3,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/parser/tableref/emptytableref.cpp","lines":["@@ -11,7 +11,9 @@ bool EmptyTableRef::Equals(const TableRef &other) const {"," }"," "," unique_ptr<TableRef> EmptyTableRef::Copy() {","-\treturn make_uniq<EmptyTableRef>();","+\tauto copy = make_uniq<EmptyTableRef>();","+\tCopyProperties(*copy);","+\treturn std::move(copy);"," }"," "," } // namespace duckdb"],"additions":3,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/parser/tableref/joinref.cpp","lines":["@@ -119,7 +119,6 @@ unique_ptr<TableRef> JoinRef::Copy() {"," \t}"," \tcopy->type = type;"," \tcopy->ref_type = ref_type;","-\tcopy->alias = alias;"," \tcopy->using_columns = using_columns;"," \tcopy->delim_flipped = delim_flipped;"," \tfor (auto &col : duplicate_eliminated_columns) {","@@ -132,6 +131,7 @@ unique_ptr<TableRef> JoinRef::Copy() {"," \tcopy->nearest_count = nearest_count;"," \tcopy->nearest_order_type = nearest_order_type;"," \tcopy->nearest_approx = nearest_approx;","+\tCopyProperties(*copy);"," \treturn std::move(copy);"," }"," "],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/parser/tableref/pivotref.cpp","lines":["@@ -340,7 +340,7 @@ unique_ptr<TableRef> PivotRef::Copy() {"," \tcopy->groups = groups;"," \tcopy->column_name_alias = column_name_alias;"," \tcopy->include_nulls = include_nulls;","-\tcopy->alias = alias;","+\tCopyProperties(*copy);"," \treturn std::move(copy);"," }"," "],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"test/api/test_query_node_copy.cpp","lines":["@@ -4,7 +4,18 @@"," #include \"duckdb/parser/common_table_expression_info.hpp\""," #include \"duckdb/parser/expression/columnref_expression.hpp\""," #include \"duckdb/parser/expression/constant_expression.hpp\"","+#include \"duckdb/catalog/catalog.hpp\"","+#include \"duckdb/catalog/catalog_entry/view_catalog_entry.hpp\"","+#include \"duckdb/main/external_dependencies.hpp\"","+#include \"duckdb/parser/parsed_data/create_view_info.hpp\"","+#include \"duckdb/parser/parser.hpp\""," #include \"duckdb/parser/query_node/select_node.hpp\"","+#include \"duckdb/parser/statement/create_statement.hpp\"","+#include \"duckdb/parser/tableref/basetableref.hpp\"","+#include \"duckdb/parser/tableref/delimgetref.hpp\"","+#include \"duckdb/parser/tableref/emptytableref.hpp\"","+#include \"duckdb/parser/tableref/joinref.hpp\"","+#include \"duckdb/parser/tableref/pivotref.hpp\""," "," using namespace duckdb;"," ","@@ -77,3 +88,121 @@ TEST_CASE(\"CTE containers preserve complete entries when copied\", \"[api][parser]"," \tREQUIRE(copied_select_entry != copied_cte_map.end());"," \tRequireEquivalentCTE(*select.cte_map.map[\"generated_cte\"], *copied_select_entry->second);"," }","+","+class TestDependencyItem : public DependencyItem {};","+","+static shared_ptr<ExternalDependency> TestDependency(const shared_ptr<DependencyItem> &item) {","+\tauto dependency = make_shared_ptr<ExternalDependency>();","+\tdependency->AddDependency(\"client_object\", item);","+\treturn dependency;","+}","+","+static void SetBaseProperties(TableRef &ref, const shared_ptr<ExternalDependency> &dependency) {","+\tref.alias = Identifier(\"ref_alias\");","+\tref.query_location = QueryLocation(7, 3);","+\tref.sample = make_uniq<SampleOptions>(42);","+\tref.sample->sample_size = Value::BIGINT(10);","+\tref.sample->is_percentage = false;","+\tref.sample->method = SampleMethod::RESERVOIR_SAMPLE;","+\tref.external_dependency = dependency;","+}","+","+static void RequireCopiedBaseProperties(const TableRef &original, const TableRef &copy) {","+\tREQUIRE(copy.type == original.type);","+\tREQUIRE(copy.alias == original.alias);","+\tREQUIRE(copy.query_location.IsValid());","+\tREQUIRE(copy.query_location.offset == original.query_location.offset);","+\tREQUIRE(copy.query_location.length == original.query_location.length);","+\tREQUIRE(copy.sample);","+\tREQUIRE(copy.sample.get() != original.sample.get());","+\tREQUIRE(SampleOptions::Equals(copy.sample.get(), original.sample.get()));","+\tREQUIRE(copy.external_dependency);","+\tREQUIRE(copy.external_dependency == original.external_dependency);","+}","+","+static unique_ptr<TableRef> TestBaseTable(const string &name) {","+\tauto ref = make_uniq<BaseTableRef>();","+\tref->SetQualifiedName(QualifiedName(Identifier(name)));","+\treturn std::move(ref);","+}","+","+static unique_ptr<TableRef> TestJoin(unique_ptr<TableRef> left) {","+\tauto join = make_uniq<JoinRef>(JoinRefType::NATURAL);","+\tjoin->left = std::move(left);","+\tjoin->right = TestBaseTable(\"join_right\");","+\treturn std::move(join);","+}","+","+static unique_ptr<TableRef> TestPivot() {","+\tauto pivot = make_uniq<PivotRef>();","+\tpivot->source = TestBaseTable(\"pivot_source\");","+\tpivot->aggregates.push_back(make_uniq<ColumnRefExpression>(Identifier(\"pivot_value\")));","+\tPivotColumn column;","+\tcolumn.pivot_expressions.push_back(make_uniq<ColumnRefExpression>(Identifier(\"pivot_key\")));","+\tPivotColumnEntry entry;","+\tentry.values.emplace_back(Value::INTEGER(1));","+\tcolumn.entries.push_back(std::move(entry));","+\tpivot->pivots.push_back(std::move(column));","+\treturn std::move(pivot);","+}","+","+TEST_CASE(\"Table reference copies keep the base table reference properties\", \"[api][parser]\") {","+\tauto item = make_shared_ptr<TestDependencyItem>();","+\tauto dependency = TestDependency(item);","+","+\tvector<unique_ptr<TableRef>> refs;","+\trefs.push_back(TestBaseTable(\"reference_kind\"));","+\trefs.push_back(TestJoin(TestBaseTable(\"join_left\")));","+\trefs.push_back(TestPivot());","+\trefs.push_back(make_uniq<EmptyTableRef>());","+\trefs.push_back(make_uniq<DelimGetRef>(vector<LogicalType> {LogicalType::INTEGER}));","+\tfor (auto &ref : refs) {","+\t\tINFO(EnumUtil::ToString(ref->type));","+\t\tSetBaseProperties(*ref, dependency);","+\t\tauto copy = ref->Copy();","+\t\tRequireCopiedBaseProperties(*ref, *copy);","+\t}","+}","+","+static void RequireViewJoinDependency(Connection &con, const string &step, const string &view_name,","+                                      const shared_ptr<DependencyItem> &item) {","+\tINFO(step);","+\tcon.BeginTransaction();","+\tauto &view = Catalog::GetEntry<ViewCatalogEntry>(*con.context, QualifiedName(Identifier(view_name)));","+\tauto &from_table = view.GetQuery().node->Cast<SelectNode>().from_table;","+\tREQUIRE(from_table->type == TableReferenceType::JOIN);","+\tREQUIRE(from_table->external_dependency);","+\tREQUIRE(from_table->external_dependency->GetDependency(\"client_object\") == item);","+\tcon.Rollback();","+}","+","+TEST_CASE(\"A view over a join keeps the external dependency of the join through catalog copies\", \"[api][parser]\") {","+\tDuckDB db(nullptr);","+\tConnection con(db);","+\tREQUIRE_NO_FAIL(con.Query(\"CREATE TABLE l (k INTEGER, a INTEGER)\"));","+\tREQUIRE_NO_FAIL(con.Query(\"CREATE TABLE r (k INTEGER, b INTEGER)\"));","+\tREQUIRE_NO_FAIL(con.Query(\"INSERT INTO l VALUES (1, 10)\"));","+\tREQUIRE_NO_FAIL(con.Query(\"INSERT INTO r VALUES (1, 20)\"));","+","+\tParser parser(*con.context);","+\tparser.ParseQuery(\"CREATE VIEW v AS SELECT * FROM l JOIN r USING (k)\");","+\tREQUIRE(parser.statements.size() == 1);","+\tauto &view_info = parser.statements[0]->Cast<CreateStatement>().info->Cast<CreateViewInfo>();","+\tauto &from_table = view_info.query->node->Cast<SelectNode>().from_table;","+\tREQUIRE(from_table->type == TableReferenceType::JOIN);","+\tauto item = make_shared_ptr<TestDependencyItem>();","+\tfrom_table->external_dependency = TestDependency(item);","+\tREQUIRE_NO_FAIL(con.Query(std::move(parser.statements[0])));","+\tRequireViewJoinDependency(con, \"CREATE VIEW\", \"v\", item);","+","+\tREQUIRE_NO_FAIL(con.Query(\"ALTER VIEW v RENAME TO w\"));","+\tRequireViewJoinDependency(con, \"ALTER VIEW RENAME\", \"w\", item);","+","+\tREQUIRE_NO_FAIL(con.Query(\"COMMENT ON VIEW w IS 'a view over a join'\"));","+\tRequireViewJoinDependency(con, \"COMMENT ON VIEW\", \"w\", item);","+","+\tauto result = con.Query(\"SELECT k, a, b FROM w\");","+\tREQUIRE(CHECK_COLUMN(result, 0, {1}));","+\tREQUIRE(CHECK_COLUMN(result, 1, {10}));","+\tREQUIRE(CHECK_COLUMN(result, 2, {20}));","+}"],"additions":129,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"test/configs/verify_statement_to_string.json","lines":["@@ -36,6 +36,12 @@","       \"paths\": [","         \"test/sql/window/test_ignore_nulls.test\"","       ]","+    },","+    {","+      \"reason\": \"Error carets point into the printed statement, which wraps a join in parentheses the typed query lacks\",","+      \"paths\": [","+        \"test/sql/error/error_location_copied_query.test\"","+      ]","     }","   ]"," }"],"additions":6,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"test/sql/error/error_location_copied_query.test","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,89 @@","+# name: test/sql/error/error_location_copied_query.test","+# description: An error raised on a join or pivot reference points at it when a copy of the query is bound","+# group: [error]","+","+statement ok","+CREATE TABLE t (a INTEGER, b INTEGER)","+","+statement ok","+CREATE TABLE x (q INTEGER)","+","+# the query as parsed is the reference for each caret of a join below","+statement error","+SELECT * FROM t NATURAL JOIN x","+----","+LINE 1: SELECT * FROM t NATURAL JOIN x","+                        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^","+","+# COPY TO binds a copy of its query","+statement error","+COPY (SELECT * FROM t NATURAL JOIN x)","+TO '{TEST_DIR}/error_location_copied_query.csv'","+----","+LINE 1: COPY (SELECT * FROM t NATURAL JOIN x)","+                              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^","+","+# CREATE VIEW binds a copy of its query","+statement error","+CREATE VIEW v AS SELECT * FROM t NATURAL JOIN x","+----","+LINE 1: CREATE VIEW v AS SELECT * FROM t NATURAL JOIN x","+                                         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^","+","+# a base table reference in a copied query is the reference case","+statement error","+CREATE VIEW v AS SELECT * FROM missing_table","+----","+LINE 1: CREATE VIEW v AS SELECT * FROM missing_table","+                                       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^","+","+# the query as parsed is the reference for each caret of a pivot below","+statement error","+SELECT * FROM t PIVOT (sum(b) FOR a IN (1, 1))","+----","+LINE 1: SELECT * FROM t PIVOT (sum(b) FOR a IN (1, 1))","+                               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^","+","+statement error","+COPY (SELECT * FROM t PIVOT (sum(b) FOR a IN (1, 1)))","+TO '{TEST_DIR}/error_location_copied_query.csv'","+----","+LINE 1: COPY (SELECT * FROM t PIVOT (sum(b) FOR a IN (1, 1)))","+                                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^","+","+statement error","+CREATE VIEW v AS SELECT * FROM t PIVOT (sum(b) FOR a IN (1, 1))","+----","+LINE 1: CREATE VIEW v AS SELECT * FROM t PIVOT (sum(b) FOR a IN (1, 1))","+                                                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^","+","+statement error","+SELECT * FROM t UNPIVOT (val FOR n IN (missing_column))","+----","+LINE 1: SELECT * FROM t UNPIVOT (val FOR n IN (missing_column))","+                                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^","+","+statement error","+CREATE VIEW v AS SELECT * FROM t UNPIVOT (val FOR n IN (missing_column))","+----","+LINE 1: CREATE VIEW v AS SELECT * FROM t UNPIVOT (val FOR n IN (missing_column))","+                                                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^","+","+# a PIVOT statement without an IN list binds a copy of its source to find the pivot values","+statement error","+PIVOT (SELECT * FROM t NATURAL JOIN x) ON a USING sum(b)","+----","+LINE 1: PIVOT (SELECT * FROM t NATURAL JOIN x) ON a USING sum(b)","+                               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^","+","+# an ORDER BY on an expression over a set operation binds a copy of the set operation","+statement error","+(SELECT * FROM t NATURAL JOIN x UNION SELECT 1, 2) ORDER BY a + 1","+----","+LINE 1: (SELECT * FROM t NATURAL JOIN x UNION SELECT 1, 2) ORDER BY a + 1","+                         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^","+","+statement error","+FROM v","+----","+Table with name v does not exist",""],"additions":89,"deletions":0,"truncated":false}],"additions":232,"deletions":4,"truncated":false,"file_count":7},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-11-07T15:04:47.753951+00:00"}